---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About me">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-12 w-full pt-4">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight uppercase">
            ABOUT <span class="text-rose-500">ME</span>
        </h1>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-start">
            <div class="w-full md:w-1/3 shrink-0 relative group">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-rose-500 rounded-xl translate-x-2 translate-y-2 opacity-50 group-hover:translate-x-4 group-hover:translate-y-4 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                <img src={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/images/foto-perfil.png"} alt="My photo" class="w-full aspect-square rounded-xl object-cover border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 relative z-10">
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium">
                    Hi, I'm Azcray Design, a thumbnail designer with experience since 2015, when I started creating my own designs for my YouTube channel.
                </p>
                <p>
                    For me, a thumbnail is not just another resource; it's a design piece that must fulfill two goals at once: be visually impeccable and strategically effective. I love making thumbnails look beautiful, with careful composition, balanced colors, and a visual hierarchy that invites people to look, but I also know their true mission is to stop the scroll and generate clicks.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Over the years, I've worked with creators from different countries, such as <strong>LordFrek</strong> and <strong>Metricar</strong>, adapting to their styles and needs. My versatility has allowed me to move comfortably across very diverse niches: gaming, technology, football, entertainment, podcast, documentaries, automobiles, news, and crypto. I approach each project with the same passion and aesthetic rigor.
                </p>
                <p>
                    If you're looking for someone who cares about every detail of your thumbnails, who understands the importance of good composition, and who also knows how to make them work with the algorithm, you've come to the right place.
                </p>
                
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 uppercase tracking-wider">Tools</h2>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded font-bold text-rose-500 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm">Photoshop</span>
                    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded font-bold text-rose-500 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm">Illustrator</span>
                    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded font-bold text-rose-500 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm">Upscayl</span>
                    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded font-bold text-rose-500 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm">Thumbsup.tv</span>
                    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded font-bold text-rose-500 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm">VidIQ</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
